[t=    1] P1.T1  R 0x0100  page 1 (outer 0, inner 1) off 0x00 | TLB MISS | PAGE FAULT -> frame 1 (free frame) | PA 0x0100
[t=    2] P1.T1  W 0x0200  page 2 (outer 0, inner 2) off 0x00 | TLB MISS | PAGE FAULT -> frame 2 (free frame) | PA 0x0200
[t=    3] P1.T1  R 0x0300  page 3 (outer 0, inner 3) off 0x00 | TLB MISS | PAGE FAULT -> frame 1 (evicted P1 page 1, clean) | PA 0x0100
[t=    4] P1.T1  R 0x0000  page 0 (outer 0, inner 0) off 0x00 | TLB HIT  | PA 0x0000
[t=    5] P1.T1  R 0x0400  page 4 (outer 0, inner 4) off 0x00 | TLB MISS | PAGE FAULT -> frame 2 (evicted P1 page 2, dirty -> write-back) | PA 0x0200
[t=    6] P1.T1  R 0x0500  page 5 (outer 0, inner 5) off 0x00 | TLB MISS | PAGE FAULT -> frame 1 (evicted P1 page 3, clean) | PA 0x0100
[t=    7] FINISH   P1.T1  turnaround=7 wait=0
[t=    7] IDLE     all threads finished

